    <string name="welcome_title">azul deɣ ylih</string>
    <string name="welcome_intro">ylih ḥseb azal n wuguren i taqcict n yal yiwet n tilli, iwakken ar ɣ-a qaren di lḥal ay tizegwa, llan-d tinigin n yal yiwet n tilling: seggen tiɣratin wacu?</string>
    <string name="welcome_point_auto_title">seqqal yeḍra</string>
    <string name="welcome_point_auto_body">taqcitin n bluetooth tineskesid d nezzeh, seg waktiɛa iṭṭweɛ. ulac anigra ilaq a yuɣal yettwasqamu.</string>
    <string name="welcome_point_lifetime_title">yiwet n tilli, umri n wuguren</string>
    <string name="welcome_point_lifetime_body">mi ara s-tiket talli, siḥ: usmun-is i tefka yella d wa, d tilling tamaynutt n taqcict nezzeh ay-tti tebda tikelt tis snat seg zeru.</string>
    <string name="welcome_point_detailed_title">taqcicin amelwas d asraz</string>
    <string name="welcome_point_detailed_body">ubbar umḍiq, di yiɣewwaṛen, iẓer taqcicin amelwas d aḥnuc n tira taḥcint iḥcen azal n waktiɛa iferriḥ.</string>
    <string name="welcome_privacy">akk ayen i tefka ay-ik si tilifen-a. ulac amiḍan, akk d useqwas d unṭernet.</string>
    <string name="welcome_start">bdu</string>
    <string name="welcome_next">aḍeffir</string>
    <string name="welcome_allow">siḥ</string>
    <string name="welcome_step">azra %1$d si %2$d</string>
    <string name="welcome_bluetooth_title">anekcum i ublutuṛt</string>
    <string name="welcome_bluetooth_why">android yecɛa aca tasiwelt taq seg umnaɣ n ublutuṛt iṭṭweɛ d wayen qqaṛen-aɣ, ma ur d-yesɛi tasiwelt n ublutuṛt. d agi i gawent ylih tasiwelt n taqcict seg umnaɣ n tazzwart, d wacu i gawent adal talɣi mi ara ɛqel yiwet si talɣi.</string>
    <string name="welcome_bluetooth_with">s wannecta: yal talli ay-tti teskesid seg waktiɛa iṭṭweɛ, war tilelli waxxa, war tallit i gira.</string>
    <string name="welcome_bluetooth_without">bla wannecta: taqcicin n bluetooth ur ay-teskesed ara. azetta n useqwas ay-yettmusniḍ, u tezmer a yeffɣ tallit tis snat deg yiɣewwaṛen n android.</string>
    <string name="welcome_notifications_title">tilɣi</string>
    <string name="welcome_notifications_why">ubbar umḍiq ay-yesseɣ takdit tawtemt, d android iḥas aca tasiwelt yal useqwas ay-yetten akken a yeqqim yeffeɣ tilɣit.</string>
    <string name="welcome_notifications_with">s wannecta: tilɣit ay-illi ayen ay-yeskesid tura, d anaw ittemzegh aca ubbar umḍiq ay-yettwasniḍ.</string>
    <string name="welcome_notifications_without">bla wannecta: ubbar umḍiq ay-yettmusniḍ d ay-yeskesid. android ur ay-d-sfeɣ tilɣit-is.</string>
    <string name="hibernation_title">qim i tḥisab id ḥemmalt</string>
    <string name="hibernation_body">android ay-ysiklay iseqwas ur ay-tufɣa seg wayla n waggur, ay-d-sqes tisilyin-nsen, d agi ay-d-dmeɣ ylih ur ay-teskesed ara hawen-d tusaniwin. d assaɣ uneccek i ylih, kra la nubeḍ a s-tmutel tura.</string>
