    <string name="settings_detailed_title">ubbar umḍiq</string>
    <string name="settings_detailed_body">iẓer taqcicin amelwas d akuraz n tira. android ay-d-ssufɣ tilɣi n usqamu amelwas i iseqwas ay-yeṭṭaqen kan, kra la nubeḍ ubbar umḍiq ay-yesɛu tilɣit tawtemt. bluetooth ay-ttubdaden s yal tawala.</string>
    <string name="settings_detailed_unavailable">ur ay-tettwili ara alamma anekcum i ublutuṛt uɣal-d. aseqwas-a ay-ḍeqqaq useqwas n imaḍen ay-yettwasɛen, d android 14+ ay-d-xles akesrum n ublutuṛt.</string>
    <string name="settings_playback_only_title">ḥseb tira kan</string>
    <string name="settings_playback_only_body">taktiwin ay-ḥsebent waktiɛa n tira tiggutt d ugar n waktiɛa n usqamu. tirkutin kan ay-teskesdin ubbar umḍiq ay-tsuḥṛen tira; wayeḍ akk ay-ttwaggẓen.</string>
