    <string name="settings_battery_body">ma tirkutin ay-tseḥ anebdad, c-ḥad ylih ur d-ay-tselḥed ara ɣef ubaghal n ubatri — aseqwas ay-d-tsikla ur ay-d-ssufɣ tilɣi n usqamu alamma ur d-tefɣa.</string>
    <string name="settings_battery_button">iɣewwaṛen n ubatri</string>
    <string name="settings_battery_path">iɣewwaṛen → iseqwas → ylih → ubatri → war wend.</string>
    <string name="settings_hibernation_body">ma ylih ur d-tefɣa seg wayla n waggur, android ay-ysiklay d ay-d-sqes tisilyin-nsen, d ulac anigra iteskesid alamma d tufɣa. kucel ayen-nni ay-teggez tallit i isizriw s uxeddim ur ay-tettxil ɣef useqwas.</string>
    <string name="settings_hibernation_on">android ay-teḥbes ylih.</string>
    <string name="settings_hibernation_off">ylih ay-d-azru d ay-yeskesid.</string>
    <string name="settings_hibernation_button">iɣewwaṛen n iseqwas ur ay-ttwaṛẓen ara</string>
